      "body": "## Summary\n- Resolve filelock to 4.2.4, above the 4.2.1 fix for CVE-2026-112940.\n- Override the transitive filelock requirement because multi-storage-client 0.51.0 still declares `filelock<4`.\n\n## Validation\n- Regenerated `uv.lock` with `uv lock --upgrade-package filelock` in the NVIDIA PyTorch 26.09 container.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n\n## Compatibility note\nThe override crosses multi-storage-client's declared upper bound. Please validate its file locking paths in CI before merging. The override should be removed when multi-storage-client supports filelock 4.\n\nAdvisory: https://github.com/tox-dev/filelock/security/advisories/GHSA-v4x8-3wr5-3wq8\n",
